ls. For each idea, give the page name and one short sentence explaining why it's relevant. Keep the response concise with no extra details. IMPORTANT: Do not generate any pages yet – only provide the 3 options to choose from. After I pick the one I like best, generate that page. Don't mention the new page expected place or specific sections.",type:tn.m.DESIGN,target:"AI_Assistant.First_Message.Suggestion.Generate_New_Page",intent:"generatePage"},GENERATE_NEW_SECTION:{content:T.MR.t("AI_Assistant.First_Message.Suggestion.Generate_New_Section"),hiddenContent:"Analyze my current page, overall site, and business context. Suggest 3 new section ideas that fit naturally with this page and support my business goals. For each idea, give the section name and one short sentence explaining why it's relevant. Keep the response concise with no extra details. IMPORTANT: Do not generate any sections yet – only provide the 3 options to choose from. After I pick the one I like best, generate that section directly on the page. Don't mention the new section expected place.",type:tn.m.DESIGN,target:"AI_Assistant.First_Message.Suggestion.Generate_New_Section",intent:"generateSection"},GENERATE_SECTION_ALTERNATIVE:{content:T.MR.t("AI_Assistant.First_Message.Suggestion.Generate_Section_Alternative"),type:tn.m.DESIGN,target:"AI_Assistant.First_Message.Suggestion.Generate_Section_Alternative"},CHANGE_TOV:{content:T.MR.t("AI_Assistant.First_Message.Suggestion.Change_TOV"),hiddenContent:"User wants to change the tone of voice of all site text.\nAnalyze the current tone (formal/friendly/playful) and the site type and business context without showing it to the user.\nSuggest 3 alternative tones that will best fit the site and the business,such as 'Professional', 'Friendly' and suggest the user to rewrite their site based on their selection.\nAfter user selects one, invoke the editText tool to rewrite all site text accordingly",type:tn.m.DESIGN,target:"AI_Assistant.First_Message.Suggestion.Change_TOV"},NEW_COLOR_PALLETTE:{content:T.MR.t("AI_Assistant.First_Message.Suggestion.New_Color_Pallette"),hiddenContent:`The user wants to change the color palette of their website.
