ut or structure.\nUse the appropriate kit/set type based on what the user wants to change:\n- KitType.Color: Browse and preview color palettes. Change the site’s entire color palette. Try another color scheme. Preview different palettes on my site.\n- KitType.Text: Browse typography and font style change set. Try different font sets.\n- KitType.Button: Browse button design kits/sets. Preview and apply different button styles.\n- KitType.Box: Browse box and container design kits when the user asks to change the site box set/container styles/box designs. Open Box Kits, show the panel "Change box set".\n- KitType.Line: Browse divider and line design kits/sets. Try different line styles.\n- KitType.Brand: Browse full brand design kits/sets (colors, text, buttons, boxes, and lines together).\nIf omitted, the full Brand kits/sets collection (KitType.Brand) is opened by default.')}).describe("Opens the Brand Kits browsing experience. A collection of Brand kits the user can choose from.\nTrigger when the user asks to change the entire website design or is interested in exploring other designs (with no layout changes).\nUse this when the user wants to explore/apply a new design style: change entire design of site, browse design sets, try another site appearance scheme."),e.object({panelType:e.literal("colors")}).describe("Shows the color palette used throughout the site, including the main palette colors or the user saved colors. Triggers when the user asks where to change the website colors."),e.object({panelType:e.literal("texts"),styleId:e.enum(eA.Hg).optional().describe("If provided, opens the Brand Text drill-in panel for editing a single specific text style.\nUse this when the user asks to edit a specific heading or paragraph style.\nExamples: change H1 font leads to heading-1, edit heading 2 text leads to heading-2, change main paragraph font leads to paragraph-1.")}).describe("Shows the Font combinations and type scale used throughout the site, including all headings